{"entrypoint": "slides/cover.html", "message": "Template Crewship Slides (mirror)", "files": [{"path": "deck.json", "media_type": "application/json", "content": "{\"schema_version\": 1, \"order\": [\"cover\", \"features\", \"chart\", \"flow\"]}"}, {"path": "slides/cover.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"cover\">\n<div id=\"cover-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#0F1F33;border-color:#0F1F33;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-panel\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1200px;top:0px;width:720px;height:1080px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"cover-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1100px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#E8833A;text-align:left\">TEMPLATE · SLIDES</p>\n<p id=\"cover-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:395px;width:1100px;height:180px;font-size:144px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left\">Crewship</p>\n<p id=\"cover-sub\" style=\"left:128px;top:578px;width:1100px;height:120px;font-size:44px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left\">Posádka AI agentů, která převezme úkol a doručí výsledek.</p>\n<p id=\"cover-date\" style=\"left:128px;top:920px;width:1100px;height:32px;font-size:24px;color:#8A9BB0;text-align:left\">Testovací deck · listopad 2026</p>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-head2\" data-shape=\"ellipse\" style=\"left:1560px;top:427px;width:109px;height:109px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:16px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-body2\" data-shape=\"ellipse\" style=\"left:1595px;top:567px;width:109px;height:109px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:16px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-mask2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1545px;top:423px;width:82px;height:117px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-mask3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1545px;top:540px;width:117px;height:105px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-head1\" data-shape=\"ellipse\" style=\"left:1490px;top:427px;width:109px;height:109px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:16px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-body1\" data-shape=\"ellipse\" style=\"left:1455px;top:567px;width:180px;height:156px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:16px\"></div>\n<div id=\"cover-icon-mask1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1430px;top:646px;width:300px;height:120px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<aside id=\"cover-notes\">Titulní slide. Ukazuje vlastní typografii (IBM Plex Sans + JetBrains Mono), gradient na pozadí, ikonu s animací pop a přechod fade.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/features.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"features\">\n<div id=\"features-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#F4F1EA;border-color:#F4F1EA;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-eyebrow\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#B85E1F;text-align:left\">CO UMÍ SLIDES</p>\n<p id=\"features-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:228px;width:1664px;height:90px;font-size:72px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Tři věci, které deck zvládne sám</p>\n<div id=\"features-card1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:128px;top:371px;width:533px;height:549px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card1-title\" style=\"left:176px;top:515px;width:437px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Komentáře</p>\n<p id=\"features-card1-body\" style=\"left:176px;top:592px;width:437px;height:120px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left\">Kolega napíše poznámku přímo k prvku slidu.</p>\n<div id=\"features-card2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:693px;top:371px;width:533px;height:549px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card2-title\" style=\"left:741px;top:515px;width:437px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Prezentace</p>\n<p id=\"features-card2-body\" style=\"left:741px;top:592px;width:437px;height:120px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left\">Režim Present s přechody a animacemi prvků.</p>\n<div id=\"features-card3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1258px;top:371px;width:534px;height:549px;background-color:#FFFDF8;border-color:#E2DCCF;border-width:1px\"></div>\n<p id=\"features-card3-title\" style=\"left:1306px;top:515px;width:438px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Export</p>\n<p id=\"features-card3-body\" style=\"left:1306px;top:592px;width:438px;height:120px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left\">Stažení jako .pptx nebo PDF jedním klikem.</p>\n<p id=\"features-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:32px;font-size:24px;color:#6A7179;text-align:left\">Template Crewship Slides · 2</p>\n<aside id=\"features-notes\">Karty s ikonami. Každý prvek jde v editoru přesunout, přepsat a okomentovat.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/chart.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"chart\">\n<div id=\"chart-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#F4F1EA;border-color:#F4F1EA;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"chart-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:90px;font-size:72px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Dokončené úkoly rostou každý týden</p>\n<p id=\"chart-big\" style=\"left:128px;top:600px;width:560px;height:192px;font-size:160px;color:#E8833A;text-align:left\">38</p>\n<p id=\"chart-big-caption\" style=\"left:128px;top:800px;width:560px;height:120px;font-size:32px;color:#4A5568;text-align:left\">úkolů v týdnu T6, trojnásobek oproti T1 (12)</p>\n<div id=\"chart-bar1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:816px;top:716px;width:96px;height:152px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:976px;top:641px;width:96px;height:227px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1136px;top:679px;width:96px;height:189px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar4\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1296px;top:565px;width:96px;height:303px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar5\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1456px;top:476px;width:96px;height:392px;background-color:#C9C2B3;border-color:#C9C2B3;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"chart-bar6\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1616px;top:388px;width:96px;height:480px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"chart-label1\" style=\"left:784px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center\">T1 · 12</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label2\" style=\"left:944px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center\">T2 · 18</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label3\" style=\"left:1104px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center\">T3 · 15</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label4\" style=\"left:1264px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center\">T4 · 24</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label5\" style=\"left:1424px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#4A5568;text-align:center\">T5 · 31</p>\n<p id=\"chart-label6\" style=\"left:1584px;top:884px;width:160px;height:36px;font-size:24px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:center\">T6 · 38</p>\n<p id=\"chart-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:32px;font-size:24px;color:#6A7179;text-align:left\">Testovací data · Template Crewship Slides · 3</p>\n<aside id=\"chart-notes\">Graf jako SVG přímo ve slidu, velké číslo jako hlavní sdělení. Data jsou testovací.</aside>\n</section>\n"}, {"path": "slides/flow.html", "media_type": "text/html", "content": "<section id=\"flow\">\n<div id=\"flow-bg\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:1920px;height:1080px;background-color:#0F1F33;border-color:#0F1F33;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-title\" style=\"left:128px;top:128px;width:1664px;height:90px;font-size:72px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left\">Jak crew pracuje</p>\n<div id=\"flow-box1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:128px;top:452px;width:344px;height:185px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box1-title\" style=\"left:168px;top:492px;width:264px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left\">Zadání</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box1-sub\" style=\"left:168px;top:557px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left\">CLI nebo web</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link1\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:472px;top:542px;width:96px;height:4px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:568px;top:452px;width:344px;height:185px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box2-title\" style=\"left:608px;top:492px;width:264px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">Kapitán</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box2-sub\" style=\"left:608px;top:557px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#0F1F33;text-align:left\">rozdělí práci</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link2\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:912px;top:542px;width:96px;height:4px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1008px;top:452px;width:344px;height:185px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box3-title\" style=\"left:1048px;top:492px;width:264px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left\">Agenti</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box3-sub\" style=\"left:1048px;top:557px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left\">každý svou roli</p>\n<div id=\"flow-link3\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1352px;top:542px;width:96px;height:4px;background-color:#E8833A;border-color:#E8833A;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<div id=\"flow-box4\" data-shape=\"rectangle\" style=\"left:1448px;top:452px;width:344px;height:185px;background-color:#16304F;border-color:#16304F;border-width:0px\"></div>\n<p id=\"flow-box4-title\" style=\"left:1488px;top:492px;width:264px;height:60px;font-size:44px;color:#F4F1EA;text-align:left\">Výsledek</p>\n<p id=\"flow-box4-sub\" style=\"left:1488px;top:557px;width:264px;height:40px;font-size:28px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left\">k review</p>\n<p id=\"flow-caption\" style=\"left:128px;top:882px;width:1664px;height:40px;font-size:32px;color:#BFCBD8;text-align:left\">Diagram ze tvarů a spojnic – v editoru jde každý box posunout.</p>\n<p id=\"flow-footer\" style=\"left:128px;top:984px;width:1664px;height:32px;font-size:24px;color:#8A9BB0;text-align:left\">Template Crewship Slides · 4</p>\n<aside id=\"flow-notes\">Diagram z nativních prvků: boxy, x-connector šipky. Export do PPTX zachová editovatelné tvary.</aside>\n</section>\n"}]}
